{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7279132638874364", "organization": {"id": "665921066602474", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "26310768968555656"}]}, "id": "1625783278409477"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7279132638874364"}]}, "id": "733690268935794"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "7279132638874364", "release_date": 1716966320, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 28}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27132961526398181"}, "id": "410689884906940"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1781585753, "id": "27033209853040016", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v70", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 64, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "27033215843039417"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "7279132638874364"}, "id": "27033215843039417", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "7279132638874364", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "322538963911527"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "499619638_1834780494054145_3934023484756535240_n.png", "id": "1627318641660871", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_1627318644994204_2071650128897524379_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=co6WdVhX6ZAQ7kNvwHzp4YL&_nc_oc=AdqKiNOufBFVZcPUg1Syzp8f4jWNUuKfMTTT-4FhTx8ibxTgeDVa-BNx-XrPZcD7OZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-goZue4_9K2c5WSC7TSDRBfrpSyeXUO-e5luPfRK5p-w&oe=6A427B95"}]}, "id": "2820416758357012", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Football: Goal Poacher (Soccer)", "keywords": ["f\u00fatbol", "cabezazo", "falta"], "long_description": "Este es un simulador de remates de cabeza y tiros libres de f\u00fatbol.\nConvi\u00e9rtete en un delantero que marca goles de cabeza y de tiro libre en un simulador de f\u00fatbol realista. Vive la emoci\u00f3n de marcar goles como un profesional en un gran estadio con miles de aficionados gritando y llevando la victoria a tu equipo.\n{732360163268093}\nOPONENTES DESAFIANTES\n\nLos defensores y porteros de este juego har\u00e1n todo lo posible para evitar que marques. Tendr\u00e1s que analizar r\u00e1pidamente sus posiciones y decidir d\u00f3nde colocar el bal\u00f3n para maximizar las posibilidades de gol (como en la vida real). Hemos a\u00f1adido opciones de c\u00e1mara lenta para que los remates de cabeza sean m\u00e1s f\u00e1ciles para los nuevos jugadores.\n{837337522777428}\nF\u00cdSICA REALISTA DEL BAL\u00d3N\n\nDesarrollamos una f\u00edsica avanzada de trayectoria para simular correctamente el movimiento del bal\u00f3n con resistencia del aire, efecto Magnus y colisiones con tu cabeza, garantizando una experiencia realista.\n\nMODO DE TIRO LIBRE\n{762032936904854}\nREPETICI\u00d3N INSTANT\u00c1NEA\n{904702569293640}\nCOMPITE EN LA CLASIFICACI\u00d3N\n\n\u00a1Marca tantos goles como puedas y sube en la clasificaci\u00f3n global! \u00a1Convi\u00e9rtete en el m\u00e1ximo goleador del mundo!\n\n{1627318641660871}\n", "short_description": "Este es un simulador de f\u00fatbol de remates de cabeza y tiros libres.\n\nConvi\u00e9rtete en un delantero que marca goles de cabeza y de tiro libre en un simulador de f\u00fatbol realista. Con una f\u00edsica precisa, gr\u00e1ficos detallados y una desafiante IA rival, podr\u00e1s vivir de forma inmersiva la emoci\u00f3n de marcar goles como un profesional en un gran estadio con miles de aficionados animando y llevando a tu equipo a la victoria."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "499619638_1834780494054145_3934023484756535240_n.png", "id": "867164639752530", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673522158_867164643085863_3077061665858926006_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fyXMQyM_u5YQ7kNvwHUJP59&_nc_oc=AdrokgWG2u_sEmXzvYmGs6RAp_mEePx9Ia_Cgker4VeSOvIxM5ija8o2Deii680epVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_XcJJRIu9om9DhvUilg65A7CEsEF3uU6H8Idv8Z9Qb4A&oe=6A42861F"}]}, "id": "2123025761644223", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Football: Goal Poacher (Soccer)", "keywords": ["football", "soccer", "header", "arcade", "freekick"], "long_description": "This is a football header and freekick simulator (soccer).\nBecome a striker who scores headers and freekicks in a realistic football simulator. Experience the thrill of scoring goals as a pro in a big stadium with thousands of fans screaming and bringing victory to your team.\n\n{969462736071825}\n# CHALLENGING OPPONENTS\nThe defenders and goalkeepers in this game will try their best to stop you from scoring. You have to quickly assert their positions and decide where to put the ball to maximize scoring chance (as in real life). We have slow-motion options so heading becomes easy for new players.\n{1506550887835503}\n# REALISTIC BALL PHYSICS\nWe developed our projectile physics to correctly simulate the ball projectile with drag, Magnus effect, and collision check with your head to ensure a realistic heading experience.\n\n\n\n# FREE-KICK MODE\n{26624820967127420}\n\n\n# INSTANT-REPLAY\n{1858222744875203}\n\n\n# COMPETE ON THE LEADERBOARD\n\n\nScore as many goals as you can and climb the global leaderboard! Let\u2019s become the world\u2019s top scorer!\n\n\n\n\n{867164639752530}\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "This is a football header and freekick simulator (soccer).\nBecome a striker who scores headers and freekicks in a realistic football simulator. With accurate physics, detailed graphics, and challenging opponent AI, you can immersively experience the thrill of scoring goals as a pro in a big stadium with thousands of fans screaming and bringing victory to your team."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "512x512.png", "id": "26362293000104720", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_26362293003438053_208407120932756873_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AkYlVdMJsGsQ7kNvwGVmhSX&_nc_oc=AdrYSolgaIjJw7Nrrmo-xTFZDRqNc9xrS2gdT1JHA0ETaygxgRyI4NqdNjlnobMoDIM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9bbK1l8ctH51t85oaqQGaf_Ba-WVZE7P3h5XvejbUO0Q&oe=6A428D1E"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotStadiumGoalNet.png", "id": "3587114328265836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035338_3587114331599169_835525116529152714_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mo7h5lOFwpIQ7kNvwHDA0TE&_nc_oc=AdoN47UgPY78BLzYIxjpv3OuIDRjCmNmj8PP592eNo4m-zgexPIhd1GP1ElUJZOMcH0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af97I_rA7_t4Y3bzrZTQgDHoY7oOI6udi4pGpaZ1Rnn2Zw&oe=6A428C14"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_025_0001 - Copy - Copy.png", "id": "2259209314422819", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982576_2259209321089485_8233948434418091561_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xstOYFvEL90Q7kNvwHqmAld&_nc_oc=Adqx6sDbP-a44KiYaAcabmqbZoXbwfcqi5W3Z4Z6g-YPbVw2oQ8_KDCI7PYtWCii64Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9oWIZZa