g goals as a pro in a big stadium with thousands of fans screaming and bringing victory to your team.\n\n{9566889240078397}\n# CHALLENGING OPPONENTS\nThe defenders and goalkeepers in this game will try their best to stop you from scoring. You have to quickly assert their positions and decide where to put the ball to maximize scoring chance (as in real life). We have slow-motion options so heading becomes easy for new players.\n\n# REALISTIC BALL PHYSICS\nWe developed our projectile physics to correctly simulate the ball projectile with drag, Magnus effect, and collision check with your head to ensure a realistic heading experience.\n{1054558193429207}\n\n\n# FREE-KICK MODE\n\n{24502713752669059}\n\n# INSTANT-REPLAY\n\n{1441983417130503}\n\n# COMPETE ON THE LEADERBOARD\n\n{1834780490720812}\nScore as many goals as you can and climb the global leaderboard! Let\u2019s become the world\u2019s top scorer!\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "This is a football header and freekick simulator (soccer).\nBecome a striker who scores headers and freekicks in a realistic football simulator. With accurate physics, detailed graphics, and challenging opponent AI, you can immersively experience the thrill of scoring goals as a pro in a big stadium with thousands of fans screaming and bringing victory to your team."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "499619638_1834780494054145_3934023484756535240_n.png", "id": "3033340040188360", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618288_3033340043521693_6528309357988200172_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xDXvDSbzr2gQ7kNvwH_XKNf&_nc_oc=AdoCCE3VpIZVy22626mntdJ16e1nS5c0sg1hh05IRvzq6WbEXXNd2sEDbI21vTjd_5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8xMCjpZjP0N_fz21gu18pangJWmWnQM2ffaIAozqSjSg&oe=6A427DB1"}]}, "id": "1201739858689171", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Football: Goal Poacher (Soccer)", "keywords": ["calcio", "colpoditesta", "calciodipunizione"], "long_description": "Questo \u00e8 un simulatore di colpi di testa e calci di punizione nel calcio.\nDiventa un attaccante che segna gol di testa e su punizione in un simulatore di calcio realistico. Vivi l\u2019emozione di segnare come un professionista in un grande stadio con migliaia di tifosi che urlano e portano la vittoria alla tua squadra.\n{1533133661488973}\nAVVERSARI IMPEGNATIVI\n{1468860185024190}\nI difensori e i portieri di questo gioco faranno del loro meglio per impedirti di segnare. Dovrai valutare rapidamente le loro posizioni e decidere dove calciare il pallone per massimizzare le possibilit\u00e0 di segnare (come nella vita reale). Abbiamo aggiunto opzioni al rallentatore per rendere i colpi di testa pi\u00f9 facili per i nuovi giocatori.\n\nFISICA REALISTICA DEL PALLONE\n\nAbbiamo sviluppato una fisica avanzata della traiettoria per simulare correttamente il movimento del pallone con resistenza dell\u2019aria, effetto Magnus e collisioni con la testa, garantendo un\u2019esperienza realistica.\n\nMODALIT\u00c0 CALCIO DI PUNIZIONE\n{968224089278560}\nREPLAY ISTANTANEO\n{875227678926486}\nCOMPETI NELLA CLASSIFICA\n\nSegna pi\u00f9 gol possibile e scala la classifica globale! Diventa il miglior marcatore del mondo!\n{3033340040188360}\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Questo \u00e8 un simulatore di calcio dedicato ai colpi di testa e ai calci di punizione.\n\nDiventa un attaccante che segna gol di testa e su calcio di punizione in un simulatore di calcio realistico. Grazie a una fisica accurata, una grafica dettagliata e un'IA avversaria impegnativa, potrai vivere in modo immersivo l'emozione di segnare gol come un professionista in un grande stadio con migliaia di tifosi in delirio, portando la tua squadra alla vittoria."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "499619638_1834780494054145_3934023484756535240_n.png", "id": "1505361617853412", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618937_1505361621186745_5703545080421007610_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2e7_5lqWRUYQ7kNvwEerviv&_nc_oc=AdoFfnn42oaHJmaIXCaW-wdoFh-Y64gmBaWFzWs9xAccsOlzilQF2BHEdiHcti_SdHo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_7pKRyVQ0ITBevM1xv2wixZk6ykFfnNI-5o_ExU0DYEA&oe=6A4296B1"}]}, "id": "998598626546875", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Football: Goal Poacher (Soccer)", "keywords": ["t\u00eate", "football", "coupfranc"], "long_description": "Il s'agit d\u2019un simulateur de t\u00eates et de coups francs de football.\nDevenez un attaquant qui marque des buts de la t\u00eate et sur coup franc dans un simulateur de football r\u00e9aliste. Ressentez l\u2019excitation de marquer des buts comme un professionnel dans un grand stade avec des milliers de supporters criant et apportant la victoire \u00e0 votre \u00e9quipe.\n\n{983812964138699}\n\nADVERSAIRES REDOUTABLES\n\nLes d\u00e9fenseurs et gardiens de ce jeu feront tout leur possible pour vous emp\u00eacher de marquer. Vous devrez rapidement analyser leurs positions et d\u00e9cider o\u00f9 placer le ballon afin de maximiser vos chances de marquer (comme dans la vraie vie). Nous avons ajout\u00e9 des options de ralenti pour rendre les t\u00eates plus faciles pour les nouveaux joueurs.\n\n{955171550717914}\nPHYSIQUE R\u00c9ALISTE DU BALLON\n\nNous avons d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 une physique de trajectoire avanc\u00e9e afin de simuler correctement la balle avec la tra\u00een\u00e9e, l\u2019effet Magnus et les collisions avec votre t\u00eate pour offrir une exp\u00e9rience de jeu r\u00e9aliste.\n\n\n\nMODE COUP FRANC\n\n{1391434252808278}\n\nREPLAY INSTANTAN\u00c9\n\n{2133545353887186}\n\nCOMP\u00c9TITION AU CLASSEMENT\n\nMarquez autant de buts que possible et grimpez dans le classement mondial ! Devenez le meilleur buteur du monde !\n\n\n\n\n\n{1505361617853412}", "short_description": "Ceci est un simulateur de t\u00eates et de coups francs de football.\n\nDevenez un attaquant qui marque des buts de la t\u00eate et sur coup franc dans un simulateur de football r\u00e9aliste. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une physique pr\u00e9cise, des graphismes d\u00e9taill\u00e9s et une IA adverse exigeante, vous pourrez vivre de mani\u00e8re immersive l\u2019excitation de marquer des buts comme un professionnel dans un grand stade rempli de milliers de supporters en d\u00e9lire, et mener votre \u00e9quipe \u00e0 la victoire."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "499619638_1834780494054145_3934023484756535240_n.png", "id": "27108292368795663", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618103_27108292375462329_5301774389503896812_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IJtzjaOXkN8Q7kNvwHrlbsT&_nc_oc=AdqY4yusR1pQ8BcQYYG6nS_jjkm76ZcbnAv9nHMqp2qP4VsaVq2XggtULlGFCQOFrX4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-G5mZzELAdtvMre0k_FWTSctwCwOPvBvWQJv88tA8mDA&oe=6A42954D"}]}, "id": "973416582344868", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Football: Goal Poacher (Soccer)", "keywords": ["Fu\u00dfball", "Kopfball", "Freisto\u00df"], "long_description": "Dies ist ein Fu\u00dfball-Kopfball- und Freisto\u00dfsimulator.\nWerde ein St\u00fcrmer, der in einem realistischen Fu\u00dfballsimulator Tore per Kopfball und Freisto\u00df erzielt. Erlebe den Nervenkitzel, wie ein Profi in einem gro\u00dfen Stadion mit tausenden jubelnden Fans Tore zu schie\u00dfen und dein Team zum Sieg zu f\u00fchren.\n{968581382837652}\nHERAUSFORDERNDE GEGNER\n{1162811149304625}\nDie Verteidiger und Torh\u00fcter in diesem Spiel werden ihr Bestes tun, um dich am Toreschie\u00dfen zu hindern. Du musst ihre Positionen schnell einsch\u00e4tzen und entscheiden, wohin du den Ball schie\u00dft, um deine Torchancen zu maximieren (wie im echten Leben). Wir haben Zeitlupenoptionen hinzugef\u00fcgt, damit Kopfballtore f\u00fcr neue Spieler einfacher werden.\n\nREALISTISCHE BALLPHYSIK\n\nWir haben unsere Flugphysik entwickelt, um den Ballflug mit Luftwiderstand, Magnus-Effekt und Kollisionen mit deinem Kopf realistisch zu simulieren und so ein authentisches Kopfball-Erlebnis zu bieten.\n\nFREISTOSS-MODUS\n{2422092488258929}\n\nSOFORT-WIEDERHOLUNG\n{838297425494052}\n\nWETTKAMPF IN DER RANGLISTE\n\nErziele so viele Tore wie m\u00f6glich und erklimme die globale Rangliste! Werde der beste Torsch\u00fctze der Welt!\n\n{27108292368795663}\n\n\n", "short_description": "Dies ist ein Fu\u00dfballspiel-Simulator f\u00fcr Kopfballtore und Freist\u00f6\u00dfe.\n\nWerde ein St\u00fcrmer, der in einem realistischen Fu\u00dfballsimulator Kopfballtore und Freist\u00f6\u00dfe erzielt. Mit pr\u00e4ziser Physik, detaillierter Grafik und einer herausfordernden Gegner-KI kannst du das aufregende Gef\u00fchl immersiv erleben, als Profi in einem gro\u00dfen Stadion mit tausenden jubelnden Fans Tore zu schie\u00dfen und dein Team zum Sieg zu f\u00fchren."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "499619638_1834780494054145_3934023484756535240_n.png", "id": "3236570633195688", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_3236570636529021_8725517693640104207_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fn_vicHvyq0Q7kNvwFl89nv&_nc_oc=Adpcj8zCxWLagmuehagcyJz_Peaoc471yHIFWGjz-DOgrCcnmVH89z4IIVLMgDa1r6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af84YgeXYINMxhte73rRtWDHYYXT9NCskEEE0PsW_ToDDg&oe=6A428FA1"}]}, "id": "859165263915417", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Football: Goal Poacher (Soccer)", "keywords": ["\u30d5\u30c3\u30c8\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb", "\u30b5\u30c3\u30ab\u30fc", "\u30d8\u30c7\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "\u30d5\u30ea\